ed. Then, while a vertex is waiting to join, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one with the lightest key is examined: it joins the tree through the edge that gave it that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key (none for the start). Each of its edges whose far end is not yet spanned is examined with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its weight, then relaxed, when the weight is below the far end’s key or the far end was not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"yet waiting, or not relaxed. An edge whose far end is already spanned, a self-loop included,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is skipped without an event and without being weighed. After its last edge the examined","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex is finished. Over every component, the next tree starts at the first vertex in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order that is not spanned.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/spanningtrees\/primevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/documentation\/SpanningTrees"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/SQ","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/SH","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SpanningTrees\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"PrimEvent","modules":[{"name":"SpanningTrees"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PrimEvent"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"PrimEvents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources